        "requirement": {
          "value": "Incorporate the company with ACRA through BizFile+ before it trades: a company name application, then incorporation. The company must have at least one director who is ordinarily resident in Singapore (Companies Act 1967 s 145(1)); foreigners must act through a corporate service provider. The company receives its UEN on incorporation.",
