        "value": "PDPA 2012: organisations must meet consent, notification, purpose limitation, accuracy, protection, retention, transfer limitation, access/correction and data breach notification obligations. A breach that is likely to cause significant harm or is of significant scale must be notified to the PDPC and affected individuals. Notify the PDPC no later than 3 calendar days after determining that a breach is notifiable, and affected individuals at the same time or after.",
